  "split_strategy": "Global normalized claim hashes group all evidence variants. Reserve original FEVER dev, ANLI test, SciFact dev and unused ANLI dev claims before any training sampling. From remaining original training only, select independent seeded label-balanced claim groups for validation/test and cap FEVER/ANLI training (one pair per claim). SciFact retains all remaining claim-document pairs, with 25 groups per primary label reserved for each internal holdout. External sets retain source labels/distributions except documented empty-input, regression-topic, exact-pair duplicate/conflict and cross-source claim-overlap exclusions; no balancing is applied to external data.",
  "cleaning": "Unicode NFC, HTML entity decoding, whitespace only. Preserve negation, numbers, case and punctuation; no stemming or stopword removal. No source metadata, label explanations or ANLI model labels enter inputs.",
  "nasa_regression_policy": "Exclude every pair mentioning Ingenuity from all prepared sets; provided NASA article is never added to training or calibration.",
